      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stretton%2C_Queensland",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The suburb's northern hills flatten toward the south, where Karawatha Forest and Calamvale Creek wetlands create a green corridor.",
